@startuml
title MedNexus AI - AI Medical Explanation

actor User
participant "React Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Node.js / Express" as Backend
participant "NCBI MeSH API" as MeSH
participant "Gemini API" as Gemini

User -> Frontend : Request explanation
Frontend -> Backend : Send term and language
Backend -> MeSH : Retrieve medical information
MeSH --> Backend : Return term details

Backend -> Gemini : Send context and explanation request
Gemini --> Backend : Return AI-generated explanation

Backend --> Frontend : Return explanation and source
Frontend --> User : Display explanation and source

@enduml
